WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:02.490
Listening. It is a skill, right?

2
00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:04.250
It's a skill you have to develop.

3
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.490
Some of us are a little
bit more adept at it.

4
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:10.650
It's something that I've
had to learn over time.

5
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:15.290
And because listening
requires waiting, and

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.050
it's active, not passive.

7
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.770
Now, think about how that
applies to seasons where you

8
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:28.820
feel like you are waiting
on God, that it's active

9
00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.280
and not passive.

10
00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:36.610
And that the nourishment that
the Lord is giving you is enough

11
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.410
to sustain you. And that
is a good word today.

12
00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:41.730
Thank you for joining me
in this DAILY FUEL session.

13
00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:45.010
I can't wait to see you
back for the next one.

14
00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:49.490
I pray that you would just continue
to fuel yourselves with the

15
00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:52.530
cleanest fuel in the world,
and that is the fuel of God.

16
00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:53.330
Let me pray for us.

17
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.860
Heavenly Father, thank
you for this time today.

18
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.970
God, thank you for all the
ways that you nourish our soul

19
00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.410
because we need it, Lord.

20
00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.980
We need it for the
workouts of life.

21
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:10.490
God, we walk into this
world and there is trouble.

22
00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:14.010
God, there's chaos, there's
disorder, like, and there's

23
00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:18.350
challenges. And we recognize,
Lord, we need fuel

24
00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:20.420
for those challenges.

25
00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:24.980
And so we praise you today,
Lord, that we can just take in

26
00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:30.720
this nourishment so that we
would be not only like prepared

27
00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:33.700
for what's going to happen out
there, because it's hard to even

28
00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:38.340
say that, but Lord, that we
would sit in your presence while

29
00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:40.960
it happens and just

30
00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:44.020
taste and see how good you are.

31
00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.800
In Jesus' name, amen.
